{:paths ["src"]
 ;; Deliberately dependency-free, for the same reason `kotoba-lang/taxlaw`
 ;; and `kotoba-lang/worklaw` are: a caller that needs to know whether it may
 ;; hold a 個人番号 should not thereby acquire a ledger, a payroll engine, or
 ;; a network client.
 ;;
 ;; And one reason particular to this library: **it never takes a 個人番号 as
 ;; an argument.** A dependency here would be a dependency of every actor that
 ;; touches payroll or tax filing, and the smallest possible surface is the
 ;; point.
 :deps {
        io.github.kotoba-lang/test {:local/root "../kotoba.test"}
        io.github.kotoba-lang/text {:local/root "../kotoba.text"}}
 :aliases
 {:test {:extra-paths ["test"]}}}
